<view class="page page--with-action followup-profile">
  <view class="page-header"><view class="page-kicker">后续参与 · 基本资料</view><view class="page-title">只留下这次联系所需要的信息</view><view class="page-desc">这些信息不会改变你的关系说明书，也不会自动公开给其他用户。你可以随时修改或删除。</view></view>
  <view class="followup-form">
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">称呼</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="40" value="{{form.displayName}}" data-field="displayName" bindinput="input" /></view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">城市或区域</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="80" value="{{form.cityArea}}" data-field="cityArea" bindinput="input" /></view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">方便参与和联系的时间</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="80" value="{{form.availability}}" data-field="availability" bindinput="input" /></view>
    <view class="section-title">联系方式</view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap">
      <view class="dl-input-label">联系渠道</view>
      <view class="contact-channel-list">
        <button wx:for="{{contactChannels}}" wx:key="value" class="contact-channel {{contact.channel === item.value ? 'contact-channel--selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="chooseContactChannel">{{item.label}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">联系方式</view><input class="dl-input" maxlength="160" value="{{contact.value}}" data-field="value" bindinput="inputContact" /></view>
    <view class="dl-input-wrap"><view class="dl-input-label">补充说明（可选）</view><textarea class="dl-input dl-textarea" maxlength="500" value="{{form.note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="input" /></view>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="field-error">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="action-bar"><button class="dl-button" loading="{{isSaving}}" bindtap="save">保存参与资料</button><button class="dl-button dl-button--ghost" bindtap="back">返回授权选择</button></view>
</view>
